<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><sup id="id21" class="ltx_sup">1</sup>Scale AI, <sup id="id22" class="ltx_sup">2</sup>University of Arizona

<br class="ltx_break"><sup id="id23" class="ltx_sup">∗</sup><span id="id24" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Work done during internship at Scale AI</span>
</span></span></span></span>
